[{"client_msg_id":"f0a77adf-723d-407b-8744-0f2540391d61","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`\\K` 便利そう…","ts":"1626664864.434900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6fX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8621ff2f-e7c9-498c-bd7c-c23ff610d604","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`$(grep -P 'nameserver\\s+\\K.*' -o /etc/resolv.conf):0` に変えれば awk を使わずに済む。（まあ、WSL2 のプロセス起動は十分速いので、起動するコマンドを減らす意味はあまりないが…）","ts":"1626664476.434700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W35fB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5f28738-3dfb-4dfc-abcf-fac8690b6bdb","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"WSL2 の .profile にこんなの書いた。上手く動いてる気がする。\n```export DISPLAY=$(grep nameserver /etc/resolv.conf | awk '{print $2}'):0\nif ! timeout 1s xset q \u0026amp;\u0026gt; /dev/null; then\n    unset DISPLAY\nfi```","ts":"1626661816.432300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"emG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48c9f9f6-fb4f-4d96-824e-cb7d66f0adc4","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`$DISPLAY` につながらないと E233 が出たりするような気が。","ts":"1626661640.431100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uhr3a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f941545b-a0ff-4cb5-9825-c982388283aa","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ですね。今、WSL2 使ってて、ホスト側の Windows に VcXsrv を立てていて、ちゃんと認識させると CUI の Vim でもクリップボード連携が直接できて便利なことに気付いたんですよね (それまでは fakeclip.vim を使っていたけど、`@+` とかは当然動かないし限界がある)","ts":"1626661106.430100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dw0R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4e9b760-0881-4731-9419-13cb7e775ea1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Xのクリップボードに繋ぎに行く、とかでしたっけ。昔あったのは。","ts":"1626660794.428100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EODbZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c31e7b91-485e-43ac-8f05-2f0f5f70c1c2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそもの目的: `$DISPLAY` が存在しない先を向いていると Vim が起動時に固まるんだったはずなので存在する時だけ設定したい\nが…なんか固まらなくなってるっぽい…? (要検証)","ts":"1626660749.427600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RJgBC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7e97e65-84b4-4fb6-bd53-420a40e7378e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそもの目的と照らし合わせて検討してみます…!!","ts":"1626660677.426500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UN="}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fb92a6b-48b1-475c-8d38-46b69f909197","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ素直にxsetかxprop入れるんで良いんじゃないの?\n\n\u003chttps://www.archlinux.jp/packages/extra/x86_64/xorg-xset/\u003e\n\u003chttps://www.archlinux.jp/packages/extra/x86_64/xorg-xprop\u003e","ts":"1626660484.426100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8rx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f87d9b22-74be-457d-a43b-be96ef5bdbb7","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"screen とかで繋ぎなおしてたりするとそもそも今繋がってる先(ローカル)が変化するので都度変更するしかなくてあきらめた","ts":"1626660446.425100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wbNI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6016a8d7-c4bb-45b0-83b2-1a60819247f8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはローカルじゃないと動かないのよ","ts":"1626660321.423900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nfBDE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4657adf-d88f-496a-95d9-f31ddf8e2e2b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`ps aux | grep Xorg` とかでどうです？","ts":"1626660310.423600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l=/UB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de39e77a-eae0-45fb-b6a9-4a1761373aeb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ、今の Vim って `$DISPLAY` と通信できなくても特に固まったりはしないんだっけ…? (昔は固まってた気がする)","ts":"1626660215.423100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L1u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ea5097a-c96a-4030-8945-1d7b1deed33e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"最終的に Vim で使いたいわけなので Vim でチェックすればいいのか :thinking_vim:","ts":"1626659979.422100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y/ch"}]},{"client_msg_id":"633a04de-e5c2-4acb-883c-1dff4ef8fc06","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"どれも `x11-utils` パッケージかな？","ts":"1626659976.422000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cCneH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d367dd2-5636-4603-929a-6c661d615bcc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`xprop` も `xdpyinfo` も入ってなかった :munen:","ts":"1626659953.421200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7m9X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c6f1026-0b2d-4c5c-81a3-d8d5707e7691","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u0026gt; I think this is \"better\" than using `xprop` and `xdpyinfo` since `xset` produces less output for `/dev/null` to eat. The OP should accept this answer.\nコメントにこんなのもあった","ts":"1626659918.420800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jb3Eo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ff5e46d-4e02-4185-8f55-2a045441b9fc","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"私のところも入ってなかったので、入れたら動いてそう。","ts":"1626659902.420500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0D0VK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f628e117-3ea7-42cf-bbb4-ff0a0c924b52","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"極論Xに繋ぎに行くクライアントならなんでも良いとは思うけど…","ts":"1626659881.420100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VEkU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"961e048e-73ec-4d0a-8d6b-5fa0894faf01","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私の環境には xset 入ってなかったな…入れないとダメなんだろうか…?","ts":"1626659787.419100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zf=A8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0bb3b23-32f8-4de3-b895-855c26ab5fc5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"外部のホストなのでパスを見るのは無理ですねー","ts":"1626659741.418600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b8dA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bf4420a-c63c-4323-9966-cc32127ad087","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"おお、 `xset` というのがあるんですね","ts":"1626659720.418200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kJF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9235a56-41b1-48ef-9987-79dc4b9df021","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`DISPLAY=host:num timeout 1s xset q` が動いたら `$DISPLAY` をセット？\n\u003chttps://stackoverflow.com/a/11965765/4570471\u003e","ts":"1626659479.417800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Stack Overflow: How to check if X server is running?","id":1,"title":"How to check if X server is running?","title_link":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/11965765/4570471","text":"Is there any way to find out if the current session user is running an Xserver (under Linux) ? I'v started off with things like: ps -e | grep X but this doesn't work always and one more thing I","thumb_url":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon@2.png?v=73d79a89bded","blocks":null,"service_name":"Stack Overflow","service_icon":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=c78bd457575a","thumb_width":316,"thumb_height":316,"from_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/11965765/4570471","original_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/11965765/4570471"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lva"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa1aea68-8776-43ab-950b-8a2af38f54f6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`/tmp/.X11-unix/`か","ts":"1626659479.417700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H4PCm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0fef13a-2e53-4cf5-b1a3-cca28cf3aa30","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"パス忘れたけどtmp以下にソケット作るはずなのでそれを確認するとかですかね","ts":"1626659418.417400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Evax3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adecc8c1-36b1-4df0-97dc-1c461ef32d9c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"指定したホストで x server が起動しているかを確認する方法って何かありますか? 起動している時だけ `$DISPLAY` 環境変数を設定したい…","ts":"1626657978.414800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c/FX0"}]}]
